  "comments": [
    {"at":0,"placement":"line","text":"Starts the hit test for fighter X when its attack move shows the hit frame. The move must have the attack flag ($1174), the animation must step forward in this frame, and $69,x must be 0. Called from the fighter update at $2233."},
    {"at":2,"placement":"side","text":"Attack flag of the move: 0 = no hit test"},
    {"at":7,"placement":"side","text":"Only in a frame with a new animation step"},
    {"at":11,"placement":"side","text":"Not while the animation runs backwards"},
    {"at":19,"placement":"side","text":"Hit frame of the move"},
    {"at":30,"placement":"line","text":"Tests if the attack of fighter X hits the opponent (opponent_index). The hit-zone table of the move gives a target extent for the opponent frame; fighter_distance must lie in the reach window ($11bb full, $11d4 half). A hit sets hit_points,x to 2 or 1, then scoring_move and the hit_reaction of the opponent. A miss changes nothing."},
    {"at":37,"placement":"side","text":"Same facing: the attacker faces the back of the opponent, or turns its back"},
    {"at":43,"placement":"side","text":"Hit-zone table of the move when the fighters face each other"},
    {"at":56,"placement":"side","text":"No run executed this path"},
    {"at":60,"placement":"side","text":"Hit-zone table of the move when the fighters face the same way"},
    {"at":79,"placement":"side","text":"Target extent for the opponent frame; $80 = this frame cannot be hit"},
    {"at":86,"placement":"side","text":"Extent + $80, for an unsigned compare"},
    {"at":92,"placement":"side","text":"Facing 0 = looks right: distance = opponent x - own x"},
    {"at":112,"placement":"side","text":"Distance + $80, for an unsigned compare"},
    {"at":118,"placement":"side","text":"Reach type of the move"},
    {"at":123,"placement":"side","text":"Reach type 0: hit when extent - reach <= distance <= extent"},
    {"at":149,"placement":"side","text":"Reach type not 0: hit when extent <= distance < extent + reach"},
    {"at":178,"placement":"side","text":"Two players: the yin-yang appears at the moment of the hit"},
    {"at":184,"placement":"side","text":"Yin-yang screen offset of fighter X"},
    {"at":212,"placement":"side","text":"Mirror of hit_test_facing: opposite distance sign and reach-type rules"},
    {"at":316,"placement":"side","text":"Move that scored, for the score table $12a3"},
    {"at":323,"placement":"side","text":"Same facing: reaction rules at hit_reaction_same_facing"},
    {"at":332,"placement":"side","text":"Moves $18, $07 and $0c give reaction $1b"},
    {"at":368,"placement":"side","text":"No run executed this path: reach type 0 gives $1a, else $16"},
    {"at":378,"placement":"line","text":"Tests the distance to the opponent against the reach type of the opponent's move. Facing each other: in range when the reach type is 0 and the distance is -17 to 19. Facing the same way: reach type not 0 and distance 3 to 31. Returns A=1 (Z clear) in range, else A=0. Called from the AI at $1dec and the input fix-up at $2414."},
    {"at":412,"placement":"side","text":"Reach type of the opponent's move"},
    {"at":419,"placement":"side","text":"Distance $ef-$ff (-17 to -1) is in range"},
    {"at":423,"placement":"side","text":"Distance 0-19 is in range"},
    {"at":433,"placement":"side","text":"No run executed this path"}
  ],
